# ───────── 二进制运行时依赖（体积大，不进仓库） / Binary runtime dependencies (large; kept out of the repository) ─────────
# 这些是随包分发的第三方二进制：ffmpeg / adb / Android SDK / 虚拟显示驱动。 / These are the third-party binaries shipped with the installer: ffmpeg / adb / Android SDK / virtual display driver.
# 安装包（DroidExtend-Setup-*.exe）里已经带齐，源码仓库不重复存一份。 / The installer (DroidExtend-Setup-*.exe) already carries them all, so the source repository does not keep a second copy.
tools/ffmpeg/
tools/platform-tools/
tools/sdk/
tools/vdd/

# ───────── 构建产物 / Build artifacts ─────────
_internal/
DroidExtend.exe
dist/
android/build/
tools/pybuild/
*.spec
# The signing key must never be published: anyone holding it can ship an
# "update" that Android will happily install over the real app.  build.py
# regenerates one automatically if it is missing.
android/droidextend.keystore
*.keystore
*.jks

# ───────── 调试与临时文件 / Debugging and temporary files ─────────
# 程序直接在仓库里跑（测试）时，虚拟屏开关用的 PowerShell 脚本落在这里。 / Scripts the
# program writes here at runtime when it is run straight from the repository.
/tmp/
tools/tmp/
tools/shots/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.h264

# ───────── 编辑器 / 系统 / Editors and system files ─────────
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# 程序运行时写在本地的配置 / Settings the program writes locally at runtime
settings.json
settings.json.tmp*
DroidExtend.log*
vdd_install.log*
data_dir.txt